__pycache__/

# NOT .schema.uids.json. It is generator-maintained bookkeeping, which is why it
# is a dotfile, but it is also part of the wire contract: it is the record of
# which uid each task owns, and a fresh clone without it re-derives them from
# scratch. Commit it alongside schema.yaml.
